  "details": "Dont have any logs or vids cause i keep forgetting them (hopefully someone else or me can upadte witha  few)\n\nanyways seems the Caching system is verry borked in current live vrchat. \nAlot of times failing to load cached versions of a avatar or world and instead Downloading the file again !\n\nexample (friend loads into avatar it downloads then switched to another like defult avatar or even another of his once loaded he switched back to prevoise avatar and some users in the world redownload that previous avatar again even tho the file is saved in the cache)\n\n(cache size also dosent matter can happen with full or empty cache or any point in between)\n\nalso seems random on what avatars dont load from cache and witch do",
